@startuml Eventora_Activity_Buat_Undangan
' ============================================================
'  EVENTORA — Activity Diagram: Membuat Undangan Baru
'  Swimlane: User | System
' ============================================================

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #ECFDF5
  BorderColor #059669
  FontColor #1E293B
  DiamondBackgroundColor #D1FAE5
  DiamondBorderColor #059669
}
skinparam ArrowColor #047857
skinparam defaultFontName Inter

title Activity Diagram — Membuat Undangan Baru (5 Step Wizard)

|#ECFDF5| **User** |
|#D1FAE5| **Sistem Eventora** |

|**User**|
start
:Klik **"Buat Undangan Baru"**\ndi Dashboard;

|**Sistem Eventora**|
:Middleware validasi sesi user;
:Render form wizard 5 langkah;

' ============================================================
'  STEP 1: DATA MEMPELAI
' ============================================================

|**User**|
:=== Step 1: Mempelai ===
Mengisi data:
• Nama Mempelai Pria
• Nama Mempelai Wanita
• Nama Ayah & Ibu (kedua pihak)
• Pesan/Sambutan;
:Klik **"Selanjutnya"**;

' ============================================================
'  STEP 2: DATA ACARA
' ============================================================

|**User**|
:=== Step 2: Acara ===
Mengisi data:
• Tanggal Acara
• Waktu Acara
• Lokasi/Venue
• URL Google Maps;
:Klik **"Selanjutnya"**;

' ============================================================
'  STEP 3: CERITA & GALERI
' ============================================================

|**User**|
:=== Step 3: Cerita & Galeri ===;

if (Tambah Love Story?) then (Ya)
  :Mengisi entri Love Story:\n• Tanggal\n• Judul\n• Deskripsi;
  note right: Dapat menambah\nmultiple entri
else (Tidak)
endif

if (Upload Foto?) then (Ya)
  :Memilih file foto\n(JPEG/PNG/WebP/GIF, max 5MB);

  |**Sistem Eventora**|
  :POST /api/upload;
  :Validasi format & ukuran file;

  if (File valid?) then (Ya)
    :Upload ke Supabase Storage\nbucket: invitation-images\npath: {user_id}/{timestamp}.{ext};
    :Return public URL;

    |**User**|
    :Foto ditampilkan di preview galeri;
  else (Tidak)
    :Return error\n(format/ukuran tidak valid);

    |**User**|
    :Melihat pesan error;
  endif
else (Tidak)
endif

|**User**|
:Klik **"Selanjutnya"**;

' ============================================================
'  STEP 4: FITUR
' ============================================================

|**User**|
:=== Step 4: Fitur ===
Mengisi (opsional):
• URL Background Musik
• Rekening Titip Hadiah:\n  - Nama Bank\n  - Nomor Rekening\n  - Nama Pemilik;
note right: Dapat menambah\nmultiple rekening
:Klik **"Selanjutnya"**;

' ============================================================
'  STEP 5: PILIH TEMA
' ============================================================

|**User**|
:=== Step 5: Tema ===
Memilih tema dari daftar:
• Emerald Garden (Rp 49.000)
• Rose Blush (Rp 49.000)
• Midnight Noir (Rp 39.000)
• Minimalist White (Rp 39.000);
:Klik **"Buat Undangan"**;

' ============================================================
'  PROSES PENYIMPANAN
' ============================================================

|**Sistem Eventora**|
:POST /api/invitations;
:Validasi sesi user\n(supabase.auth.getUser);
:Generate slug unik:\n{groom}-{bride}-{random};

if (Ada Google Maps URL?) then (Ya)
  :resolveMapUrl()\nResolve shortened URL;
else (Tidak)
endif

:INSERT INTO invitations\n(status: 'draft');

if (Simpan berhasil?) then (Ya)
  :Return data undangan\ndengan slug & id;

  |**User**|
  :Toast sukses\n"Undangan berhasil dibuat!";
  :Redirect ke\n**/dashboard/invitations**;
  stop

else (Gagal)
  :Return error response;

  |**User**|
  :Toast error\n"Gagal membuat undangan";
  stop
endif

@enduml
